-- Scoped selection (ex4). Twin of 004-scoped-selection.bqn.
-- Six townsfolk across two cities, some of them merchants. @ is the locative: where the selection stands, not what it is.
-- @ Whiterun is the locative scope: AND with the region's membership mask (region = :Whiterun, shipped as a bind mask — the .reg format has no derived column). Row 2 is inside Whiterun but no merchant; rows 1, 5 are merchants but in Riften.
--! registry ../registries/004-scoped-selection.reg
--! expect gold = 5100 100 100 5100 100 100

Merchant @ Whiterun , Gold += 5000
